# Optional. Both must be set for the site to send any analytics at all;
# leave both unset (the default) and src/components/Analytics.astro renders
# nothing and sends nothing. There is no built-in default host - this repo
# is public, so a hardcoded analytics endpoint here would either be wrong
# for your fork or leak whose it is. See docs/analytics-proposal.md.
#
# PUBLIC_UMAMI_SRC: the full script.js URL of YOUR Umami instance
#   (self-hosted: https://your-umami-host/script.js; Umami Cloud: see your
#   Umami dashboard's tracking-code snippet for the exact URL).
# PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID: the website id Umami assigned this site.
PUBLIC_UMAMI_SRC=
PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=
